youranmod.jei.trichlorosilane.info=The purity of trichlorosilane is counted in nines (1 nine is 90%, 3 nines are 99.9%). It is stored with the fluid and shown after its name.\nDifferent purities cannot share a tank.\nOne pass through a Solar Distiller or a Distillation Tower turns every 10 mB into 9 mB with one more nine, up to 32. A leftover of less than one batch in the distiller is distilled as a batch after a while.
youranmod.jei.ore_washing_wafer=Ore Washing Plant: Wafers
youranmod.jei.ore_washing_wafer.note=Water purity %s%% (scrap, 9-nine wafers)
youranmod.jei.ore_washing_wafer.scrap=gold cast %s, clay cast %s
youranmod.jei.trichlorosilane_hydrogen.info=Made from trichlorosilane of at least 9 nines and IC2 hydrogen, in an Immersive Engineering Refinery or a Tinkers' Smeltery. It keeps the purity of the trichlorosilane; anything below 9 nines will not work.\nPouring 1000 mB into a Doped Wafer Cast gives one silicon wafer: Tinkers' Casting Table, IC2 Canning Machine (enrich mode) or Immersive Engineering Bottling Machine.
youranmod.jei.wafer.info=A silicon wafer keeps the purity of the mixture it was cast from, and remembers whether the cast was gold or clay.\nA freshly cast wafer has to be washed in an IC2 Ore Washing Plant (1000 mB of water each). It comes out as a Precision Silicon Wafer, or ruined. Wafers below 9 nines are always ruined.\nSee "Ore Washing Plant: Wafers" for what each kind of water does.
youranmod.jei.scrap_wafer.info=A silicon wafer ruined in washing. Smelt it in a furnace or an Immersive Engineering Arc Furnace back into an Alchemistry silicon ingot, and walk the silicon line again from the start.
youranmod.jei.naphthalene.info=Naphthalene: white flaky crystals. When creosote (Immersive Engineering or IC2) is distilled in an Immersive Petroleum Distillation Tower, one drops now and then besides the arenes and cresol.
